{"id":"614325","name":"奶香紫薯花卷","author":"不做妖精好多年","authorId":"1806550","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/614325/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"紫薯","amount":"1个"},{"name":"发酵面团","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"炼乳","amount":"1匙"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"紫薯洗净蒸熟。","img":"images/614325/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"取出来。","img":"images/614325/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"取一些薯肉，压成薯泥。","img":"images/614325/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"放炼乳。","img":"images/614325/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"拌匀。","img":"images/614325/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"面团揉光。","img":"images/614325/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"擀皮。","img":"images/614325/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"抹薯泥。","img":"images/614325/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"卷起来。","img":"images/614325/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"切开。","img":"images/614325/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"编起来。","img":"images/614325/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"卷成花朵，二次发酵后入蒸锅。","img":"images/614325/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"大火烧开，改中火蒸20分钟，焖5分钟。","img":"images/614325/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"取出来摆盘。","img":"images/614325/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/614325/step_15.jpg"}],"tips":"为了吃紫薯，薯泥放的多，薄薄一层的话，蒸出来的花朵更好看。 \n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：蒸锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}